{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>方力申（小方）一向形象健康，但近日在節目中重返母校聖若瑟書院，竟被昔日中文科老師大爆他曾是反叛學生！老師更憶述他中二時的作文題目「我的夢想」，內容竟是希望有6呎高，背後原因曝光後，更牽扯出他對奧運的畢生夢想與遺憾，故事既搞笑又感人。</p><p>中學老師驚爆小方反叛史 曾着喇叭褲長頭髮返學</p><p>在節目《家傳之「保」2》中，小方認為中學時期對個人成長影響最深，故特別重返母校聖若瑟書院，與已退休的中文科老師周月齡聚舊。周老師一見面就大爆小方曾經相當反叛，試過留長頭髮、穿喇叭褲上學，她憶述當時對小方說：「我話你唔好跟啲壞人，你要學好，點知第二日返學你剪短咗啲頭髮，同埋着番一條正經嘅校服褲返嚟。」可見小方雖然貪玩，但本性純良聽教。</p><p>作文「我夢想」竟是6呎高？背後原因超熱血</p><p>師生重聚，周老師突然問小方還記不記得中二時一篇名為「我的夢想」的作文內容，小方想也不想便秒速回答：「我要有6呎高！」這個答案令人意想不到，但背後原因卻與他的游泳事業息息相關。周老師隨即為他解釋：「因為你嗰篇作文話你想代表香港參加奧運會，我好記得你同我講『人高呢，腳板就大，腳板大就游水更加快。』」小方也笑著補充說：「好似蛙鞋咁樣。」原來這個看似無厘頭的夢想，滿載著他對游泳的熱血與執著。</p><p>憶述奧運夢想 小方自爆睇何詩蓓攞獎牌激動到喊</p><p>這個「6呎高」的夢想，源於他渴望站上奧運舞台的決心。小方在節目中憶述，當時在作文裡寫下：「我要企上奧運嘅頒獎台」。正因為這個夢想深植心中，即使自己未能達成，當看到後輩圓夢時，他亦感同身受。小方坦言：「所以我之後我睇到何詩蓓攞到奧運獎牌嘅時候，我係激動到喊，因為呢個曾經係我嘅夢想。」一番話道出了運動員之間傳承的感動。</p><p>網民洗版大讚有共鳴：「估唔到小方都有呢一面」</p><p>節目播出後，小方這段青澀的往事引起網民熱烈討論，不少人都表示非常有共鳴。網民紛紛留言：「每個男仔中學都反叛過啦，好真實！」、「6呎高個理由笑死，但又好合理，不愧係運動員！」、「估唔到小方都有呢一面，但聽完老師講，佢第二日就改，證明佢好乖仔。」、「聽到佢講何詩蓓嗰度有啲感動，呢個係運動員之間嘅共鳴。」、「周老師記性好好，呢啲師生情好難得。」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/01_16434034096a6306a36fb7a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/02_7603787176a6306a68c058.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/03_17196421846a6306a9d8fbc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/04_5632794656a6306ad1a2bd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/05_17868962006a6306b0785d1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/06_10158908346a6306b4a9323.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/07_2460465386a6306b81342e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/08_4053213596a6306bc3e19b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/09_14762267436a6306bf8ca02.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/10_7720330706a6306c31ee34.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/11_13001644146a6306c71bb4f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/12_18541436816a6306c9ece8f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/13_15314663716a6306cda06d8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/14_4100334236a6306d1491de.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15_2494999356a6306d469cb5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/16_11460689036a6306d7c6036.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17_2078182836a6306db0e1ce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18_19881132286a6306dece679.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/19_7717322166a6306e235319.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20_17600397946a6306e5ecc3a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/21_18522426946a6306e97803a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/22_19753693266a6306ecc702b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/23_3388385636a6306f042b5c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/24_16088450696a6306f3999d8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/25_336749066a6306f76ac6e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/26_14007471626a6306fad8625.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/27_6846002106a6306feb9466.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/28_7214723626a630702688cf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/29_14085007246a630705cf9d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>方力申女友Maple Yip為何加入了邪教？</p><p>Maple Yip曾經在2022年3月現身南韓一個反邪教組織舉行記招，當中她提到於2011年時自己還是高中生，因感覺生活空虛，在銅鑼灣被攝理教教徒⋯⋯ 詳情請看</p><p>方力申與女友Maple Yip感情發展迅速？</p><p>方力申日前在出席活動時，公開回應自己與邪教性侵受害者Maple Yip的緋聞，不但大方承認戀情，更提及雙方家長⋯⋯ 詳情請看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T06:39:09.240177+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1146,"images":29,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}